  criterion -->|observability fixed at agreement| kind
  kind -->|observable behavior| run
  kind -->|subjective| judged
  run -->|check not set up| rerun
  run -->|supports it| supported
  run -->|contradicts it| contradicted
  rerun async_1@-.->|participant runs it| run
  supported -->|yes| proven
  supported -->|no or unsure| unmet
  contradicted -->|no| unmet
  contradicted -->|yes · agent says what the preview showed| rerun
  judged -->|yes, on an observed workflow| proven
  judged -->|no or unsure| unmet
